xcheck 1
# Lead L-1 of docs/liftoff-crosscheck-report.md (2026-11-28). Synthetic, no hardware claim.
# Topology and the first three frames are those of frames/section7/value-checks-before-test-commit.xcheck
# (frames half-alpha-one-layer, rot180-on-overlay, opaque-on-primary); the xr24 frames are added here
# as controls, the same frames with a buffer whose format has no alpha channel.
# Plane 40 (primary) has no `pixel blend mode` property (blend=-); plane 41 lists opaque and premul.
# Observed classes in the run of 2026-11-28, both model settings:
#   half-alpha-one-layer   liftoff-only  core NoPlane layer=1 ALPHA|BLEND|IN_USE; libliftoff 40,41
#   rot180-on-overlay      liftoff-only  core NoPlane layer=1 BLEND|TRANSFORM|IN_USE; libliftoff 40,41
#   opaque-on-primary      both-accept   but core uses plane 41, libliftoff plane 40
#   xr24-*                 both-accept   (controls)
# Deciding rule: core lets a blend=opaque layer onto a plane without blend modes only when the format is
# known to be opaque (planner.rs `blend_free`); AR24 has alpha, so plane 40 is refused for the bottom
# layer. libliftoff skips the missing property for value 0 (None) and the model accepts opaque on a
# plane without the property, as a kernel would (nothing to set).
origin synthetic 2026-11-28 two-plane topology with differing alpha, blend and transform support for the value checks row
profile generic
output 31 1920 1080 60000
plane 40 kind=primary outputs=0x1 zpos=fixed:0 alpha=0 blend=- transforms=normal scaling=none max_source=none full_output=0
  format AR24 0x0
  format XR24 0x0
plane 41 kind=overlay outputs=0x1 zpos=fixed:1 alpha=1 blend=opaque,premul transforms=normal,rot180 scaling=none max_source=none full_output=0
  format AR24 0x0
  format XR24 0x0
buffer 1 1920 1080 AR24 0x0
buffer 2 1920 1080 XR24 0x0
frame half-alpha-one-layer output=31
  layer buffer=1 src=0,0,1920,1080 dst=0,0,1920,1080 z=0 alpha=65535 blend=opaque transform=normal
  layer buffer=1 src=0,0,1920,1080 dst=0,0,1920,1080 z=1 alpha=32768 blend=premul transform=normal
end
frame rot180-on-overlay output=31
  layer buffer=1 src=0,0,1920,1080 dst=0,0,1920,1080 z=0 alpha=65535 blend=opaque transform=normal
  layer buffer=1 src=0,0,1920,1080 dst=0,0,1920,1080 z=1 alpha=65535 blend=premul transform=rot180
end
frame opaque-on-primary output=31
  layer buffer=1 src=0,0,1920,1080 dst=0,0,1920,1080 z=0 alpha=65535 blend=opaque transform=normal
end
frame xr24-half-alpha-one-layer output=31
  layer buffer=2 src=0,0,1920,1080 dst=0,0,1920,1080 z=0 alpha=65535 blend=opaque transform=normal
  layer buffer=1 src=0,0,1920,1080 dst=0,0,1920,1080 z=1 alpha=32768 blend=premul transform=normal
end
frame xr24-rot180-on-overlay output=31
  layer buffer=2 src=0,0,1920,1080 dst=0,0,1920,1080 z=0 alpha=65535 blend=opaque transform=normal
  layer buffer=1 src=0,0,1920,1080 dst=0,0,1920,1080 z=1 alpha=65535 blend=premul transform=rot180
end
